    "Hello! 👋\n\nPrerna Shah has partnered with Anava Clinics to offer neuromodulation sessions to her clients.\n\n🌿 What is it?\nA gentle, non-invasive therapy that can support calmer mood, lower anxiety and better sleep.\n✔ Works alongside your current therapy and medication\n✔ Nothing you do now needs to change\n\nNeuromodulation uses very gentle stimulation to support the brain's natural \nability to regulate mood, stress and sleep.\n\n- tDCS: a soft headband with two damp sponge pads delivers a very mild current for about 20 - 30 minutes.\n- tVNS: a small ear clip gently stimulates a nerve linked to calm and relaxation.\n\n📝 About this form\n⏱ Takes about 3 minutes\n🔒 Information is shared only with Prerna Shah and the Anava Clinics care team\n\n🔗 Learn more\nAnava Clinics: https://anavaclinics.com\nPrerna Shah: https://prernatherapy.com\n\n— Anava Clinics Pvt Ltd",
